      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, we've been able to pin this down to transforming GameObjects with rigidbodies specifically, although it's still somewhat random which GameObjects it actually affects. I've been able to prevent it from happening by setting Interpolation to None and then re-enabling it after waiting a few frames after the transform, but that did not work for Fairplex who also tried that with their code.\n\nsetting the position of both the GameObject AND the rigidbody does seem to work as a temporary workaround but given how random this bug seems to be, it's unclear how else it could manifest elsewhere in people's worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
