      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Fairplex was able to figure out that the transform bug I was experiencing can be worked around by calling Physics.SyncTransforms(); right after the transform or by checking the 'Auto Sync Transforms' in Project Settings -> Physics. If VRC handles this differently than ClientSim does, it may be related.",
