      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some investigation, is does not appears as a Unity bug, but rather an intentional change!\n\nWe can call Physics.SyncTransforms() after changing Transform.position, or update both Transform.position and Rigidbody.position as proper ways to teleport Rigidbodies.\n\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/auto-sync-transforms.603568/#post-4058146",
